        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Ordered that the order is reversed insofar as appealed from, on the law, with costs, and the defendant’s motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint is denied.",
        "statement_status": "current_disposition"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E003",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "On August 10, 2007, the plaintiff, an employee of the third-party defendant, Janitronics, allegedly was injured when she slipped and fell on a wet floor while working in a building owned by the defendant.",
        "statement_status": "allegation"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E004",
        "passage_id": "P002",
        "quote": "In support of its motion for summary judgment, the defendant relied principally upon the plaintiff’s deposition testimony. In that testimony, the plaintiff stated that she slipped and fell on a wet portion of a hallway in an area of the defendant’s building near a landing and stairwell. It appeared to her that the floor had just been mopped.",
        "statement_status": "testimony_or_record"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E005",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "She further testified that, after speaking with an employee of the defendant right after the accident, whom the plaintiff could only identify as a “Jamaican” person, this person advised her that another employee of the defendant, whom the plaintiff could only recall as a “Mexican” person, had mopped that area. She was sure, from dealing with these two people in the past, that they were, in fact, employees of the defendant and not employees of the company for which *1079 she worked.",
        "statement_status": "testimony_or_record"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E006",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "Under the facts as testified to by the plaintiff, the defendant failed to establish that it did not create the condition complained of",
        "statement_status": "court_finding"
      },
