        "evidence_id": "E007",
        "passage_id": "P004",
        "quote": "While plaintiff’s affidavit was clearer than her opaque deposition testimony in explaining the exact mechanism of her fall, the two are not contradictory, and whatever discrepancies exist between them raised credibility questions that cannot be answered in the summary judgment context",
